    <h2 id="about-h">About</h2>
    <p>I landed at the intersection of machine learning and application security almost by chance, and stayed because the problems are genuinely interesting: deciding what to trust, and proving it.</p>
    <p>Recent work spans risk-scoring pipelines for vulnerability triage, certified LLM escalation for AI-generated code, and agentic RAG systems for forecasting and compliance. Alongside that I ran large-scale technical events as Head of Events for IEEE-SSIT at VIT Vellore, where I am finishing a B.Tech in Computer Science (2023 to 2027, 9.02 CGPA).</p>
    <p>Hackathons so far: top 40 in ZS Campus Beats (India-wide), 5th overall at HackX 3.0, top 20 at DevSpace.</p>
